                    /* [SWS_Dcm_00875]: By receiving a valid ROE request with the sub-function
                    clearResponseOnEvent (0x06) the RoeEvents change to the "ROE cleared" state. */
                    /* [SWS_Dcm_00884]: By receiving a valid ROE request with the sub-function
                    clearResponseOnEvent (0x06) all started RoeEvents change to the "ROE cleared" state. */
                    /* [SWS_Dcm_00906]: If ResponseOnEvent is started in a non-default session, the
                    EventWindowTime ends if one of the following conditions is fulfilled:
                    1.The power cycle ends
                    2.Receiving a clearResponseOnEvent request
                    3.Receiving a stopResponseOnEvent request
                    4.With any session change. */
                    Dcm_86_ClearEventInfo(&infoBuffer[eventBufIndex]);
